{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "A Thug's Ascension",
    "steam_appid": 2391950,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391950/extras/d5e6abf820d0472b789877ec75484d36.avif?t=1719117589\" /></span><br><br>Step into the dying metropolis of Maratha as the feared mercenary \u2018Chief', and join a gang of outlaws in the war against billionaire industrialist Dr. Sarkar and his violent attempts to rebuild the nation's greatest city in his own image. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391950/extras/e911393e22ddffacf286645111738f00.avif?t=1719117589\" /></span><br><br>This is a dark, grounded, character-driven crime drama, exploring the dreams, chaos, and mental turmoil of two broken men with clashing ideologies, brought up on opposite sides of the great bridge. It's the story of what it means for them to find the human inside them once again, and as painful as it may be, rediscover who they once were.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391950/extras/f6ecae376587cedf4cc95cdfddcdc016.avif?t=1719117589\" /></span><br><br>In this epic four-hour-long campaign combining intense first-person shooter gameplay with deeply emotional storytelling, you explore, shoot, drive, and wreck your way through the slow-paced, dialogue-driven story delivered through the 47,000-word-long screenplay penned by writer-director Adi Chandra.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391950/extras/d5e6abf820d0472b789877ec75484d36.avif?t=1719117589\" /></span><br><br>Step into the dying metropolis of Maratha as the feared mercenary \u2018Chief', and join a gang of outlaws in the war against billionaire industrialist Dr. Sarkar and his violent attempts to rebuild the nation's greatest city in his own image. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391950/extras/e911393e22ddffacf286645111738f00.avif?t=1719117589\" /></span><br><br>This is a dark, grounded, character-driven crime drama, exploring the dreams, chaos, and mental turmoil of two broken men with clashing ideologies, brought up on opposite sides of the great bridge. It's the story of what it means for them to find the human inside them once again, and as painful as it may be, rediscover who they once were.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391950/extras/f6ecae376587cedf4cc95cdfddcdc016.avif?t=1719117589\" /></span><br><br>In this epic four-hour-long campaign combining intense first-person shooter gameplay with deeply emotional storytelling, you explore, shoot, drive, and wreck your way through the slow-paced, dialogue-driven story delivered through the 47,000-word-long screenplay penned by writer-director Adi Chandra.",
    "short_description": "A Thug's Ascension is a low-poly action-adventure / FPS story set in the dying city of Maratha, circa 2023. Become Chief, a feared mercenary, and experience a dark, slow-paced crime drama marrying cinematic, dialogue-driven storytelling with intense shooting and driving gameplay.",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201cA beautiful story... Powerful and well-written narrative\u201d<br />\r\n\u2014Indie Games Devel<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cAn engaging, entertaining crime drama\u201d<br />\r\n\u2014IGR<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cA narrative powerhouse that engages with its depth and complexity\u201d<br />\r\n\u2014TheBigBois<br />\r\n",
